SUMMARY:MST - Hwy 151 To Pisgah Inn FITNESS HIKE
DESCRIPTION:The Asheville Hiking Group\nThe Hike will start at the parking
  area at the end of Hwy 151 where it meets the parkway.\nWe will hike up t
 he MST until we reach the parking lot near the summit of Mt. Pisgah. Then\
 , just for fun we will hike up to the summit of Mt Pisgah and back down. F
 rom there we will continue on the MST until we reach the Pisgah Inn. We wi
 ll have a break and snacks on the lawn behind the Inn and enjoy the view b
 efore heading back to the starting point.\nThe hike will be about 9.5 mile
 s with 2800' elevation gain.\n\n**Pace:** We will hike at a brisk pace ave
 raging approximately 2 1/2 to 3 mph adjusting for steepness of grade and r
 ugged trail conditions. Please be comfortable with this distance\, elevati
 on and pace.\n**Dogs\; F**riendly dogs ok.\n\n**Car Pool or Follow to the 
 trailhead.** To Carpool\, meet at the Westgate Plaza parking lot near the 
 Tesla charging station below Earthfare at 8:45 am. Please post if you plan
  to meet us there otherwise we will see U at the trailhead at 9:30 am.\n\n
 **Hike Levels:** Level (1) Up to 600 feet\; Level (2) 600'- 900'\; Level (
 3) 900' - 1200'\; Level (4) 1200' - 1500'\; Level (5) 1\,500' - 1\,800'\; 
 Level (6) 1\,800' - 2\,100'\; Level (7) 2\,100' - 2\,400'\; Level (8) 2\,4
 00' - 2700'\; Level (9) 2700' - 3000' Level (10) 3000' - 4000'\; Ultimate 
 Hikes are > 4\,000'.\n**Hike Cancellation:** IF YOU SIGN ON THIS HIKE AND 
 CHANGE YOU MIND (EVEN IF ON THE WAITLIST) GO BACK TO THE RSVP LINK AND CHA
 NGE YOUR HIKE STATUS TO FREE UP YOUR RESERVED SPOT.\n**Release of Liabilit
 y:**\nThe organizer of this trip is a volunteer and not a professional gui
 de. The function of the organizer is only to organize this trip. If you si
 gn up or participate in this event you acknowledge that you freely and vol
 untarily agree to assume all risks of injuries\, illnesses\, and damages a
 rising from\, as a result of\, and associated with this event. In addition
 \, you acknowledge that you agree to the Meetup terms: [https://www.meetup
 .com/terms](https://www.meetup.com/terms)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/ashevillehikinggroup/events/314220346
 /
