SUMMARY:Wild Flower #2 - Cat Gap John Rock
DESCRIPTION:The Asheville Hiking Group\nWe will meet at the Fish Hatchery 
 / Pisgah Center for Wildlife Education. We will hike clockwise up the Cat 
 Gap Loop to the John Rock trail.\n\nThere should be nice wildflowers this 
 time of year\, although it has been a dry spring.\n\nWe will hike up to Jo
 hn Rock\, stop for a snack and social chatting\, and then continue around 
 the loop to the junction with Cat Gap trail.\n\nRating: Strenuous but doab
 le\nDistance: 5.5 miles\nElevation: 1\,000 feet\nSurface: Trail\nPace: 3 m
 ph on the flats\, 2.5 mph up John Rock\nGear: water\, snack\, poles.\nFeat
 ures: River\, view of Looking Glass Rock\, Ravens.\nDogs: On leash\nRoute:
  [Cat Gap Trail](https://www.alltrails.com/explore/map/cat-gap-trail-to-jo
 hn-rock-loop-2b515e2--2?p=-1&sh=ifwm3x&utm_medium=map_share&utm_source=all
 trails_virality) to John Rock Loop on AllTrails\n\nAfter Eats: Ecusta Brew
 ing\n\nRSVP and On-Time Start:\n- If you decide you cannot come\, please c
 hange your RSVP.\n- There are generally 1 or 2 no-shows on my hikes\, so w
 e don't wait for people to arrive. If you are late\, you'll be left behind
 .\n- There is no cell service at the trailhead.\n\nGuests: No guests\, no 
 plus ones. Please ask guests to sign up for the hike themselves.\n\nDiscla
 imer and Release of Liability:\nThis activity involves hiking on city stre
 ets that may have traffic and/or natural trails with roots\, rocks\, and s
 teep sections. Participants are responsible for their safety on streets an
 d trails. The organizer of this trip is a volunteer and not a professional
  guide. The function of the organizer is only to organize this trip. If yo
 u sign up or participate in this event you acknowledge that you freely and
  voluntarily agree to assume all risks of injuries\, illnesses\, and damag
 es arising from\, as a result of\, and associated with this event. In addi
 tion\, you acknowledge that you agree to the Meetup terms: [https://www.me
 etup.com/terms](https://www.meetup.com/terms)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/ashevillehikinggroup/events/314273559
 /
