SUMMARY:Cat Gap John Rock
DESCRIPTION:The Asheville Hiking Group\njoin me for a smaller group\, non-
 intensive out and back to the John Rock overlook\, taking time to apprecia
 te the emerging flora and spring blooms.\n\napprox 4.7 miles and 875 feet 
 of elevation gain\n\nwell behaved dogs welcome\, but they will need to be 
 leashed for their safety as we approach the rock face\n\nsay 2 - 2.5 mph p
 ace\n\ncarpooling is encouraged due to limited parking at the trailhead as
  the site is under construction\n\nmore details\, location pin\, and fine 
 print forthcoming. if you came on any of my hikes last season the same ter
 ms apply
